  "post_content": "<p>(15 FOTOS) Aquest diumenge s&#39;ha realitzat una nova edici&oacute; de Suera Obert Museu (SOM), organitzada pel Centre Cultural, que ha consistit en una visita guiada per les exposicons permanents a diferents cases del poble. Una vegada m&eacute;s ha coincidit amb la mostra de Comerciants de Sueras.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/04/IMG_0536.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Hi haur&agrave; una nova edici&oacute; del SOM diumenge 17 d&#39;abril, amb motiu dels actes d&#39;ianuguraci&oacute; de l&#39;&agrave;rea per a autocaravanes al Pla del Riu, promoguda per l&#39;Ajuntament de Suera.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somabril16/img_0531.jpg\" alt=\"img_0531\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somabril16/img_0532.jpg\" alt=\"img_0532\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somabril16/img_0533.jpg\" alt=\"img_0533\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somabril16/img_0535.jpg\" alt=\"img_0535\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somabril16/img_0536.jpg\" alt=\"img_0536\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somabril16/img_0539.jpg\" alt=\"img_0539\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somabril16/img_0541.jpg\" alt=\"img_0541\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/somabril16/img_0542.jpg\" alt=\"img_0542\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d471543